# Package Manager: pnpm

This project uses **pnpm** as its package manager (run all package commands from this directory).

- **Always** use `pnpm` commands instead of `npm` or `yarn`
- `pnpm install` — install dependencies
- `pnpm add <pkg>` / `pnpm add -D <pkg>` — add dependencies
- `pnpm run <script>` or `pnpm <script>` — run scripts
- `pnpm remove <pkg>` — remove dependencies
- **Never** use `npm install`, `npm run`, `yarn add`, etc. in this directory
